			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 761920101,
					"content": "看來今天運氣不太好，等了這麼久，就連普通的霜鰭鯨也沒見到幾隻…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赫卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920102,
					"content": "唔…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玫熙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920103,
					"content": "不然今天就算了，先回去吧，以後還會有機會的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赫卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920104,
					"content": "可是…可是你這次回來待不了多久就又會去其他地方吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玫熙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920105,
					"content": "我們再等一下吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玫熙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920106,
					"content": "欸？難道是赫卡？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莉奈婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920107,
					"content": "莉奈婭姐姐。是的，我回來了，不過我的圖鑑還差一點才能完成，所以現在還不能和妳分個勝負。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赫卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920108,
					"content": "哦？這樣說來你這次遠行也收獲不少啊。不過這段時間我也沒閒著，我也為圖鑑增補了不少內容呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莉奈婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920109,
					"content": "莉奈婭姐姐也是來看那隻霜鰭鯨的嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玫熙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920110,
					"content": "對啊對啊，聽說是最近才被發現的，考慮到牠的體型，我推測是環境變化導致了表皮顏色的變化。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莉奈婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920111,
					"content": "比方說，環境中月矩力的濃度之類的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莉奈婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920112,
					"content": "很可惜，今天大概是見不到了。我們已經等很久了，但還是一無所獲。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赫卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920113,
					"content": "莉奈婭姐姐，妳也勸勸她，今天我們就先回去…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赫卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920114,
					"content": "我沒事的，今天醒來的時候就覺得狀態比平常都好，我們再等一下吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玫熙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920115,
					"content": "據說見到那隻霜鰭鯨的人，想要實現的願望就能成真。那就代表牠是會帶來好運的動物吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玫熙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920116,
					"content": "我希望赫卡能夠帶著牠送來的好運再出發。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玫熙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920117,
					"content": "可是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赫卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920118,
					"content": "那我們就一起等吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莉奈婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920119,
					"content": "莉奈婭姐姐！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赫卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920120,
					"content": "你先別急嘛，我有預感，今天一定能看到那隻霜鰭鯨的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莉奈婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920121,
					"content": "赫卡也知道的吧？我的預感一向很準。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莉奈婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920122,
					"content": "好吧…那就再等一下，但是真的只能一下哦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赫卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920123,
					"content": "等了一下…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920124
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761920124,
					"content": "快看快看！哇，牠跳得好高！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莉奈婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920125,
					"content": "要是我也能游得那麼快就好了，如果能和牠們同遊，一定會很快樂吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莉奈婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920126,
					"content": "乾脆現在就下水試試看——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莉奈婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920127,
					"content": "那也太危險了！唉，離開這麼久回來一看，莉奈婭姐姐還是這麼冒失…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赫卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920128,
					"content": "哪、哪有！赫卡難道不想和牠們一起玩耍嗎？牠們玩得那麼開心欸！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莉奈婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920129,
					"content": "可是衣服弄濕了著涼就不好了，不如留在岸上，用留影機記錄下牠們開心的樣子吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761920130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玫熙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761920130,
					"content": "這樣講也有道理…那就借赫卡的留影機一用了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "莉奈婭"
				}
			]
		},
